    "items": [
      "The Snowclad trio (`DLC2EncTribalWerebearA`–`C`, level 17) use the bandit berserker `EncBandit02Melee2HBerserkNordM` 03DEA5 as their template without `Stats`, so changing the bandit rung does not move them.",
